# VEVO Video Release - FE Mapping Guide

Backend dung Release hien co lam ban ghi chinh va gan them Video metadata 1-1.

- Release metadata: `releases` va cac module con cua release.
- Video metadata: `videos`.
- Video artist rieng: `video_artist`.
- Video contributor/credits rieng: `video_contributors`.
- Khi xuat DDEX VEVO: neu video co `videoArtists/videoContributors` thi dung du lieu rieng cua video; neu chua co thi fallback ve `releaseArtists/releaseContributors`.

## API chinh

### Tao video release draft

`POST /releases/draft`

Body can co:

```json
{
  "type": "video",
  "title": "Video title",
  "version": "Official Video",
  "upc": "893...",
  "albumFormatId": "xxxxxxxxxx",
  "primaryGenreId": "xxxxxxxxxx",
  "labelId": "xxxxxxxxxx",
  "releaseDate": "2026-06-01",
  "cLineOwner": "Copyright owner",
  "cLineYear": 2026,
  "video": {
    "isrc": "USXXX2600001",
    "explicit": false,
    "aiContent": "UNDETERMINED",
    "channel": "ArtistVEVO",
    "contentProvider": "Content Provider",
    "copyrightOwner": "Work owner",
    "description": "YouTube description",
    "keywords": ["keyword 1", "keyword 2"],
    "isKids": false,
    "isUnlisted": false,
    "fileId": "uuid-video-file",
    "subtitles": [
      {
        "language": "en",
        "fileId": "uuid-caption-file",
        "fileName": "caption.srt"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

### Cap nhat video release draft

`PUT /releases/draft/:releaseId`

- Gui `video` object de create/update video metadata theo `releaseId`.
- Gui `"video": null` de xoa video metadata khoi release.
- Khong gui `video` thi giu nguyen video metadata hien co.

### Lay release detail

`GET /releases/:id`

Response co `video`, `releaseArtists`, `releaseContributors`, `releaseLanguage`, `releaseTerritory`, `releaseCoverArts`.

### CRUD video metadata rieng

Co the dung khi can sua video metadata truc tiep:

- `POST /videos`
- `GET /videos`
- `GET /videos/:id`
- `GET /videos/release/:releaseId`
- `PUT /videos/:id`
- `DELETE /videos/:id`

### CRUD video artists

Dung cho truong "Nghe si chinh" va "Nghe si ket hop" neu FE muon gan rieng cho video.

- `POST /video-artists`
- `POST /video-artists/bulk`
- `GET /video-artists?videoId=:videoId`
- `GET /video-artists/:id`
- `PUT /video-artists/:id`
- `DELETE /video-artists/:id`

Body:

```json
{
  "videoId": "uuid-video",
  "artistId": "xxxxxxxxxx"
}
```

### CRUD video contributors / credits

Dung cho Credits: Composer(s), Editor(s), Producer(s), Director(s).

- `POST /video-contributors`
- `POST /video-contributors/bulk`
- `GET /video-contributors?videoId=:videoId`
- `GET /video-contributors/:id`
- `PUT /video-contributors/:id`
- `DELETE /video-contributors/:id`

Body:

```json
{
  "videoId": "uuid-video",
  "artistId": "xxxxxxxxxx",
  "artistRoleId": "uuid-artist-role"
}
```

## Tab Chi tiet - field mapping

| UI field | Backend field/API | Required | Note |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Tieu de Video | `CreateReleaseDraftDto.title` / `Release.title` | Yes | Max 150. |
| Nghe si chinh | `POST /video-artists` hoac module `release-artist` | Yes | Neu gan rieng cho video thi dung `video-artists`. Neu khong, co the dung `release-artist` de fallback. |
| Nghe si ket hop | `POST /video-artists` hoac module `release-artist` | No | Video artist khong co role rieng, tuong tu `release_artist`. |
| The loai | `CreateReleaseDraftDto.primaryGenreId` / `Release.primaryGenreId` | Yes | ID genre length 10. |
| Ngon ngu | `releaseLanguage.metadataLanguageId` va/hoac `releaseLanguage.audioLanguageId` | Yes | Dung nested `releaseLanguage` trong `PUT /releases/draft/:id` hoac API release-language hien co. |
| Noi dung nhay cam (Explicit) | `video.explicit` | No | Boolean `true/false`. |
| Co chua noi dung AI | `video.aiContent` | No | Enum: `"ALL"`, `"PARTLY"`, `"NONE"`, `"UNDETERMINED"`. Default `"UNDETERMINED"`. |
| ISRC | `video.isrc` | Yes | ISRC cua video. Khong dung Audio ISRC. |
| Video file | `video.fileId` | Yes khi submit VEVO | File ID tu bucket upload video. |
| Thumbnail file | `releaseCoverArt.fileId` / `release_cover_art` | Yes khi submit VEVO | Dung cover art original cua release. |
| Captions/subtitles | `video.subtitles[]` | No | Moi item: `{ language, fileId, fileName }`. |
| Nha cung cap noi dung | `video.contentProvider` | Yes tren UI | Text max 100. |
| Chu so huu tac pham | `video.copyrightOwner` | Yes tren UI | Text max 150. Khac voi copyright line o tab Bo sung. |
| Kenh | `video.channel` | Yes | Ten kenh YouTube/VEVO. |
| Tu khoa | `video.keywords` | No | Array string. |
| Mo ta | `video.description` | Yes tren UI | YouTube description. |
| Danh cho tre em | `video.isKids` | No | Boolean `true/false`. |
| Dang khong cong khai | `video.isUnlisted` | No | Boolean. Neu true xuat ProprietaryId `VEVO:YouTubeUnlisted`. |

## Tab Bo sung - field mapping

| UI field | Backend field/API | Required | Note |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| UPC | `CreateReleaseDraftDto.upc` / `Release.upc` | No | Optional doi voi video. Neu bo trong, backend co the generate theo flow UPC hien co neu can. |
| Audio ISRC | Ignore | No | Field nay thua, FE khong can gui. ISRC dung `video.isrc` o tab Chi tiet. |
| Video version | `CreateReleaseDraftDto.version` / `Release.version` | No | Text do FE tu khai bao/truyen. |
| Partner custom ID 1 | `video.partnerCustomId1` | No | Text max 100. |
| Partner custom ID 2 | `video.partnerCustomId2` | No | Text max 100. |
| Composer(s) | `POST /video-contributors` voi role Composer | No | FE lay `artistRoleId` cua Composer tu Artist Role. |
| Editor(s) | `POST /video-contributors` voi role Editor | No | FE lay `artistRoleId` cua Editor tu Artist Role. |
| Producer(s) | `POST /video-contributors` voi role Producer | No | FE lay `artistRoleId` cua Producer tu Artist Role. |
| Director(s) | `POST /video-contributors` voi role Director | No | FE lay `artistRoleId` cua Director tu Artist Role. |
| Copyright | `CreateReleaseDraftDto.cLineOwner` / `Release.cLineOwner` | No | Copyright owner/text cua C-Line. |
| Copyright year | `CreateReleaseDraftDto.cLineYear` / `Release.cLineYear` | No | Nam C-Line. |

Neu FE can P-Line rieng, backend da co:

- `pLineOwner`
- `pLineYear`

Nhung UI hien tai field `Copyright/Copyright year` map vao C-Line: `cLineOwner/cLineYear`.

## Tab Phan phoi - field mapping

Dung flow release distribution hien co.

| UI field/logic | Backend field/API | Note |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Territory / quoc gia phan phoi | `releaseTerritory` | Nested trong `PUT /releases/draft/:id` hoac API release-territory hien co. |
| DSP VEVO selected | `releaseDspDeliveries` / submit dto codes | Khi submit gui code DSP `VEVO`. |
| Submit distribution | `POST /releases/:id/submit3` hoac submit flow hien co | Worker se sinh DDEX ERN 4.3 va upload VEVO S3. |

## Suggested FE save flow

### Create form lan dau

1. Upload video file vao bucket bang `POST /bucket2/private/bulk` voi `uploadPurpose = "video_file"` -> lay `fileId`.
2. Upload thumbnail bang `POST /bucket2/private/bulk` voi `uploadPurpose = "release_cover_art"` -> lay `fileId`, tao/update `releaseCoverArt`.
3. Upload subtitle/caption files bang `POST /bucket2/private/bulk` voi `uploadPurpose = "video_caption"` -> lay cac `fileId`.
4. `POST /releases/draft` voi `type = "video"` va nested `video`.
5. Sau khi response co `release.id` va `release.video.id`, tao artists/credits:
   - `POST /video-artists/bulk`
   - `POST /video-contributors/bulk`
6. Cap nhat territory/dsp bang module hien co neu tab Phan phoi co thay doi.

### Edit form

1. `PUT /releases/draft/:releaseId` de update release fields + nested `video`.
2. Artist/credit thay doi thi dung CRUD `video-artists` / `video-contributors`.
3. Neu user remove video metadata: gui `video: null`.

## DDEX/VEVO delivery behavior

Khi submit DSP `VEVO`:

1. Backend stream assets tu bucket ve temp server folder.
2. Tao DDEX ERN 4.3 XML.
3. Upload assets len VEVO S3 truoc: video, thumbnail, subtitles.
4. Upload XML manifest sau cung.
5. Khong upload `delivery.complete`, `BatchComplete`, hay done marker cho VEVO.

Cron scanner:

- Neu thay `success-$ISRC.json`: cap nhat VEVO delivery status thanh `DISTRIBUTED`.
- Neu thay `failure-$ISRC.json`: cap nhat status thanh issue/failed va luu message loi.

