- `videoId`
- `artistId`

### `videoContributors`

- `videoId`
- `artistId`
- `artistRoleId`

## Upload assets

Dung chung API bucket giong flow upload audio track.

### Tao presigned upload URL

`POST /bucket2/private/bulk`

Video file:

```json
{
  "bucketDtos": [
    {
      "file": {
        "fileName": "video.mp4",
        "contentType": "video/mp4",
        "extension": "mp4",
        "fileSize": 123456
      },
      "folderBucket": {
        "uploadPurpose": "video_file",
        "releaseId": "uuid-release"
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

Caption/subtitle file:

```json
{
  "bucketDtos": [
    {
      "file": {
        "fileName": "caption.srt",
        "contentType": "application/x-subrip",
        "extension": "srt",
        "fileSize": 1234
      },
      "folderBucket": {
        "uploadPurpose": "video_caption",
        "releaseId": "uuid-release"
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

Response tra ve `fileId` va `urlUpload`. FE upload binary len `urlUpload`, sau do luu `fileId` vao:

- Video file -> `video.fileId`
- Caption/subtitle -> `video.subtitles[].fileId`

Sau khi upload thanh cong, neu can danh dau file da submit thi dung:

`POST /bucket2/private/bulk/submit`

```json
{
  "ids": ["uuid-file-1", "uuid-file-2"]
}
```
